---
<BaseLayout
  title="Auckland Wedding Photographers | Moments In Light"
  description="Capture the magic of your wedding day with stunning, heartfelt photography. Book your dream wedding photographer today!"
  image={slides[0][0]}
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap intro">
      <h1>Wedding Photography</h1>
      <p>Every wedding is different, but my approach is to keep things simple, considered, and complete — so you can focus on enjoying the day without worrying about what’s included.</p>
      <p>I offer full-day wedding photography coverage, capturing everything from the preparations through to the evening celebrations. The focus is always on documenting the day naturally, with a calm and unobtrusive approach.</p>
      <p>My packages aim to avoid frustrating limitations, choose a plan and then choose how you use your time. I include everything needed to properly capture your wedding from start to finish.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Same size as Squarespace's "medium" slideshow: half the window's height on desktop,
       30% on phones. Fades to the next photo every 5 seconds. -->
  <Slideshow
    label="Wedding photographs"
    heightMobile="30vh"
    heightDesktop="50vh"
    interval={5}
    first
    images={slides.map(([path, w, h], i) => ({ src: path, alt: `Auckland wedding photograph ${i + 1} of ${slides.length}`, width: w, height: h }))}
  />

  <section>
    <div class="wrap packages">
      {packages.map((p) => (
        <article class="package">
          <h2>{p.name}</h2>
          <p>{p.intro}</p>
          <ul>
            {p.items.map(([head, body]) => <li><strong>{head}</strong> – <Fragment set:html={body} /></li>)}
          </ul>
          <p class="price" style={`--blank:${p.blankLines}`}><strong>All-inclusive price {p.price} ♥</strong></p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="wrap note">
      <p>♥ I don’t watch the clock so if the time allowance is ending as you are cutting the cake, I’m not heading home. These are just a guide; you can always add extra time if needed. The only additional cost you have is that you need to arrange a meal for me, venues are all very used to this as it’s very normal. It’s a long day and vendors need to eat too.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap buttons buttons--three">
      <a class="btn" href="/a-guide-to-your-wedding-photos">How I Work</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/wedding-faqs">FAQs</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/contact">Check now to see if your date is available</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-alt slant slant--up">
    <div class="wrap real">
      <div class="real-intro">
        <h2>Real weddings with real couples</h2>
        <p>Here are my latest 9 weddings but you can see more on the wedding galleries page. These are real weddings with real couples.  When you contact me I can provide links to the full wedding so you can see what a whole gallery looks like.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="cards">
        {realWeddings.map((r) => (
          <li>
            <a class="card-img" href={r.href} tabindex="-1">
              <Img src={r.img} alt={r.title} width={r.w} height={r.h} sizes="(min-width: 768px) 43vw, 83vw" />
            </a>
            <a class="card-title" href={r.href}>{r.title}</a>
            <a class="card-more" href={r.href} aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">Read more →</a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <div class="buttons buttons--two">
        <a class="btn" href="/wedding-galleries">More Galleries</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/contact">Check now to see if your date is available</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Phone layout first (390px reference), desktop overrides below (1440px reference). */
  .intro { padding-block: 35px 14px; }

  .packages { display: grid; gap: 11px; padding-top: 2px; }
  .package {
    background: var(--griseo);
    border-radius: 25px;
    padding: 20px 21px 47px;
    color: var(--green);
  }
  .package h2 { margin: 0 0 30px; }
  .package ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 40px; }
  .package li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .package li::marker { color: var(--green); font-size: 0.8em; }
  .package strong { font-weight: 700; }
  .price { margin: calc(var(--blank) * 35px + 9px) 0 0 40px; }

  .note { padding-block: 20px 36px; color: var(--green); }

  .buttons { display: grid; gap: 11px; }
  /* Room below the buttons, plus the height the next section's angled edge overlaps. */
  .buttons--three { padding-bottom: calc(48px + var(--slant, 2vw)); }
  .buttons .btn { min-height: 59px; padding-block: 0; }

  .real { padding-block: 0 30px; }
  .real-intro { margin-bottom: 50px; }
  .cards { list-style: none; margin: 0 11px 40px; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 30px; }
  .card-img :global(img) { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; object-fit: cover; }
  .card-title { display: block; margin-top: 15px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; text-decoration: none; }
  .card-more { display: block; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; text-decoration: none; }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .intro { padding-block: 0 31px; }

    .packages {
      grid-template-columns: 41.74vw 41.74vw;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 0;
      padding-top: 41px;
    }
    .package { padding: 36px 36px 44px; }
    .package li { margin-bottom: 9px; }
    .note { padding-block: 50px 56px; }

    .buttons--three {
      position: relative;
      /* button height + space below + the next section's angled edge */
      height: calc(68px + 64px + 2vw);
      display: block;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .buttons .btn { position: absolute; top: 0; height: 68px; min-height: 0; }
    .buttons--three .btn:nth-child(1) { left: 15.63vw; width: 14.72vw; }
    .buttons--three .btn:nth-child(2) { left: 42.64vw; width: 14.72vw; }
    .buttons--three .btn:nth-child(3) { left: 69.72vw; width: 22.43vw; }

    .real { padding-block: 41px 30px; }
    .real-intro { padding-inline: 3.82vw 0; margin-bottom: 50px; }
    .cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      column-gap: 20px;
      row-gap: 31px;
      margin: 0 2.71vw 80px 2.71vw;
    }
    .buttons--two { position: relative; height: 68px; display: block; }
    .buttons--two .btn:nth-child(1) { left: 3.82vw; width: 14.72vw; top: 0; }
    .buttons--two .btn:nth-child(2) { right: 3.82vw; width: 22.43vw; top: 0; }
  }
</style>
